      <h1>Battery Demand Forecast: The Road to 3 TWh</h1>
      <p class="muted">Battery Market Intelligence · IEA scenarios · Last reviewed 2026-09-16</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> Global battery demand is on a path to <strong>roughly triple this
        decade</strong>: EV battery demand is projected to exceed <strong>3 TWh by 2030</strong>, up from about
        <strong>1 TWh in 2024</strong>, with <strong>stationary storage</strong> adding roughly <strong>400–500 GWh</strong>
        in 2030 — about 12% of EV battery demand. The IEA's scenarios show batteries doubling their share of clean
        energy investment within seven years.
      </div>
